{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 79,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.188232421875,
        513.426025390625,
        96.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "4 months at the dosages specified in Recommendation 8 (see Recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18475341796875,
        513.4260864257812,
        112.5362548828125
      ],
      "text": "8). Children with suspected or confirmed pulmonary TB or tuberculous peripheral",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.1812744140625,
        513.4603271484375,
        128.53277587890625
      ],
      "text": "lymphadenitis in settings with a high HIV prevalence (or with confirmed HIV infection)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17779541015625,
        513.3798828125,
        144.529296875
      ],
      "text": "should not be treated with intermittent regimens (that is, twice- or thrice-weekly doses)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        147.17431640625,
        216.04739379882812,
        160.52581787109375
      ],
      "text": "(see Recommendation 26).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        171.68084716796875,
        513.4833984375,
        185.0323486328125
      ],
      "text": "Each child should be assessed 2 weeks after the start of TB treatment then reviewed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        187.6773681640625,
        513.4030151367188,
        201.02886962890625
      ],
      "text": "monthly with clinical monitoring, which should include symptom assessment, weight",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        203.67388916015625,
        513.4029541015625,
        217.025390625
      ],
      "text": "measurement, assessment of adherence to treatment and enquiry about any adverse",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        219.67041015625,
        513.4146118164062,
        233.02191162109375
      ],
      "text": "events. Dosages of anti-TB drugs should be adjusted to account for any weight gain.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        235.66693115234375,
        513.4259033203125,
        249.0184326171875
      ],
      "text": "Most children living with HIV with drug-sensitive TB who are compliant with therapy",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        251.6634521484375,
        513.4375,
        265.01495361328125
      ],
      "text": "have a good response to the 6-month regimen. Possible reasons for treatment failure",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        267.65997314453125,
        513.3915405273438,
        281.011474609375
      ],
      "text": "are non-compliance with therapy, drug-resistant TB or alternative diagnoses (incorrect",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        283.656494140625,
        168.7709197998047,
        297.00799560546875
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis of TB).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        308.16302490234375,
        513.4605712890625,
        321.5145263671875
      ],
      "text": "All children living with HIV who have successfully completed treatment for TB disease",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        324.09051513671875,
        353.2309265136719,
        337.5110168457031
      ],
      "text": "(6) should receive isoniazid for an additional 6 months  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        348.666015625,
        513.3915405273438,
        362.01751708984375
      ],
      "text": "When compared with HIV-negative children, responses to TB treatment and outcome are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        364.6625061035156,
        513.3914794921875,
        378.0140075683594
      ],
      "text": "poorer for children living with HIV. Before the availability of ART, many deaths in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        380.65899658203125,
        513.3799438476562,
        394.010498046875
      ],
      "text": "with TB/HIV occurred in the first 2 months following the start of TB treatment. Medical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        396.6554870605469,
        510.2520751953125,
        410.0069885253906
      ],
      "text": "risk factors for poor treatment response and mortality include severe malnutrition, co-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        412.6519775390625,
        370.90643310546875,
        426.00347900390625
      ],
      "text": "infections, severe immunosuppression and high viral load.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        437.1584777832031,
        513.3914184570312,
        450.5099792480469
      ],
      "text": "Additional therapy recommended for HIV-infected children with TB, which may help to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        453.15496826171875,
        513.414306640625,
        466.5064697265625
      ],
      "text": "improve TB treatment outcomes, includes co-trimoxazole preventive therapy, the early",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        469.1514587402344,
        513.4261474609375,
        482.5029602050781
      ],
      "text": "start of ART (see below) and pyridoxine supplementation along with nutritional support",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        485.14794921875,
        212.85040283203125,
        498.49945068359375
      ],
      "text": "(see details in Chapter 4).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        511.36834716796875,
        281.75537109375,
        528.0963745117188
      ],
      "text": "Co-trimoxazole preventive therapy",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        531.9425048828125,
        513.4490356445312,
        545.2940063476562
      ],
      "text": "Co-trimoxazole is a broad-spectrum antimicrobial agent that prevents a range of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        547.9390258789062,
        513.4031372070312,
        561.29052734375
      ],
      "text": "secondary bacterial and parasitic infections in eligible adults and children living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        563.9354858398438,
        513.3914184570312,
        577.2869873046875
      ],
      "text": "Daily prophylaxis – co-trimoxazole preventive therapy (CPT) - prolongs survival in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        579.9320068359375,
        513.4376220703125,
        593.2835083007812
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV and reduces the incidence of co-morbidities. It also reduces the risk of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        595.9285278320312,
        513.403076171875,
        609.280029296875
      ],
      "text": "co-infections such as pneumocystis pneumonia in HIV-exposed infants. CPT is therefore",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        611.9249877929688,
        513.3916015625,
        625.2764892578125
      ],
      "text": "recommended for all HIV-exposed infants and children living with HIV, including those",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        627.8525390625,
        510.22906494140625,
        641.2730102539062
      ],
      "text": "(1) with TB  , and should be implemented as an integral component of a package of HIV-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        643.8490600585938,
        187.6999053955078,
        657.26953125
      ],
      "text": "(13) related services  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        668.4244995117188,
        513.4144897460938,
        681.7760009765625
      ],
      "text": "The indications for initiating, discontinuing and monitoring CPT are included in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        684.4210205078125,
        513.4375,
        697.7725219726562
      ],
      "text": "2006 WHO guidelines on co-trimoxazole prophylaxis for HIV-related infections among",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        700.3485717773438,
        502.9839782714844,
        713.76904296875
      ],
      "text": "(14) children, adolescents and adults: recommendations for a public health approach  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0443115234375,
        726.60693359375,
        207.07229614257812,
        743.3349609375
      ],
      "text": "Antiretroviral therapy",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        747.1849975585938,
        513.4374389648438,
        760.5364990234375
      ],
      "text": "Antiretroviral therapy (ART) in children living with HIV aims to improve the length and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        763.1815185546875,
        513.4605712890625,
        776.5330200195312
      ],
      "text": "quality of life, reduce HIV-related morbidity and mortality by reducing the incidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "60",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}